{"id":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter1#def:loop-and-pi1-set","title":"def:loop-and-pi1-set","path":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter1.md","line":69,"body":"","kind":"definition","status":"not_started","tex":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter1.tex#def:loop-and-pi1-set","uses":["[[references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter1#def:path]]","[[references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter1#def:homotopy-of-paths]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter1.tex","label":"def:loop-and-pi1-set","line":110,"source":"\\begin{definition}[Loop, basepoint, and the set $\\pi_1(X,x_0)$]\n\\label{def:loop-and-pi1-set}\n\n\\uses{def:path, def:homotopy-of-paths}\n\n\\group{Fundamental Group}\n\nA loop at $x_0\\in X$ is a path $f:I\\to X$ with $f(0)=f(1)=x_0$. The set of\nhomotopy classes of loops at $x_0$ is denoted $\\pi_1(X,x_0)$.\n\\end{definition}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Definition</div></section>[Loop, basepoint, and the set <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\pi _1(X,x_0)$\">$\\pi _1(X,x_0)$</span>] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-6465663a6c6f6f702d616e642d7069312d736574\"></span> <p></p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FHatcher%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter1%23def%3Apath\">↗ def:path</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FHatcher%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter1%23def%3Ahomotopy-of-paths\">↗ def:homotopy-of-paths</a> <p></p>\\group Fundamental Group <p></p>A loop at <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$x_0\\in X$\">$x_0\\in X$</span> is a path <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$f:I\\to X$\">$f:I\\to X$</span> with <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$f(0)=f(1)=x_0$\">$f(0)=f(1)=x_0$</span>. The set of homotopy classes of loops at <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$x_0$\">$x_0$</span> is denoted <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\pi _1(X,x_0)$\">$\\pi _1(X,x_0)$</span>. ","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: group"]},"previous":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter1#def:path-composition","next":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter1#prop:pi1-is-a-group","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter1#def:path","title":"def:path","label":"def:path"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter1#def:homotopy-of-paths","title":"def:homotopy-of-paths","label":"def:homotopy-of-paths"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter1#prop:pi1-is-a-group","title":"prop:pi1-is-a-group","label":"prop:pi1-is-a-group"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter1#ex:convex-set-trivial-pi1","title":"ex:convex-set-trivial-pi1","label":"ex:convex-set-trivial-pi1"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter1#def:change-of-basepoint-map","title":"def:change-of-basepoint-map","label":"def:change-of-basepoint-map"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter1#def:simply-connected","title":"def:simply-connected","label":"def:simply-connected"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter1#thm:fundamental-group-of-circle","title":"thm:fundamental-group-of-circle","label":"thm:fundamental-group-of-circle"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter1#prop:pi1-of-product-space","title":"prop:pi1-of-product-space","label":"prop:pi1-of-product-space"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter1#def:induced-homomorphism","title":"def:induced-homomorphism","label":"def:induced-homomorphism"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter1#lem:loop-deco